              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹೊಸ ರಸ್ತೆಯಿಂದ ಊರಿನ ಅಭಿವೃದ್ಧಿ ಆಯಿತು. hosa rasteyinda ūrina abhivṛddhi āyitu. The new road brought development to the town."
