          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹೂಡು — hūḍu — \"to invest\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಾನು ಉಳಿಸಿದ ಹಣವನ್ನು ಒಂದು ಅಂಗಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಹೂಡಿದೆ. nānu uḷisida haṇavannu ondu aṅgaḍiyalli hūḍide. I invested the money I had saved in a shop."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಹೂಡಿದೆ, hūḍide."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹೂಡಿಕೆ, an investment. Also to yoke: ಎತ್ತು ಹೂಡು (hūḍu)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹೂಡು (hūḍu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 4361 lists Kannada pūḍu, \"to join, to tie to, to yoke, to fix, to arrange\"; old p- became h-, and \"to put money to work\" is the modern sense."
            }
          ]
        },
